        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter Quizverse – a relaxed and clever quiz game that tests your knowledge in a fun way!</strong> <br>Whether you're a logic fan, science enthusiast or just curious, Quizverse challenges you with exciting questions from a wide range of topics and lets you try to beat your high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its varied but challenging questions, Quizverse offers the perfect blend of learning and entertainment – ideal for short breaks or long brainstorming sessions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different game modes:</strong> Test your knowledge in Free Play mode, take on 15 consecutive questions in Millionaire mode (with or without a time limit), or play under pressure in the 100 Seconds mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 1,000 varied questions covering a wide range of topics:</strong> geography, history, sport, film &amp; music, technology, natural sciences and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and challenging gameplay:</strong> designed for single players – no stress, just you and your knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score attack &amp; high score tracking:</strong> Challenge yourself, improve your score and compare yourself with the high scores of others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam achievements:</strong> Unlock numerous achievements by achieving high scores, building up series and demonstrating your knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing for just a few minutes or diving into the high score marathon, Quizverse makes knowledge fun again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your knowledge, discover new things and become the master of Quizverse!</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter Quizverse – a relaxed and clever quiz game that tests your knowledge in a fun way!</strong> <br>Whether you're a logic fan, science enthusiast or just curious, Quizverse challenges you with exciting questions from a wide range of topics and lets you try to beat your high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its varied but challenging questions, Quizverse offers the perfect blend of learning and entertainment – ideal for short breaks or long brainstorming sessions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different game modes:</strong> Test your knowledge in Free Play mode, take on 15 consecutive questions in Millionaire mode (with or without a time limit), or play under pressure in the 100 Seconds mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 1,000 varied questions covering a wide range of topics:</strong> geography, history, sport, film &amp; music, technology, natural sciences and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and challenging gameplay:</strong> designed for single players – no stress, just you and your knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Score attack &amp; high score tracking:</strong> Challenge yourself, improve your score and compare yourself with the high scores of others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam achievements:</strong> Unlock numerous achievements by achieving high scores, building up series and demonstrating your knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing for just a few minutes or diving into the high score marathon, Quizverse makes knowledge fun again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your knowledge, discover new things and become the master of Quizverse!</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "A relaxing quiz game with Free Play, Millionaire (with and without timer), and 100-Second modes. Test your knowledge with over 1,000 questions on geography, history, sport, science and more – beat your high score and have fun doing it!",
